" ghpr setup  3/7 When to use it · work                                          "
"Which directories is work for?                                                  "
"Comma-separated; ~ is your home. ghpr uses work anywhere under them.            "
"                                                                                "
"› ~/work, ~/clients                                                             "
"                                                                                "
"                                                                                "
